-----------------Install Ansible ----------------------

Install Notes

- Recommend virtual machine for testing
- Any Enterprise Linux(EL) is recommended.
- Installs on Debian, Ubuntu, macOS, BSD, Windows Subsystem for Linux (WSL).
- Upcoming pip commands should work the same on Mac.

-----Inside the codespace ------

- sudo dnf install -y  python3-pip
- pip install ansible
- pip install ansible -U // upgrade the ansible

-- ansible --version // verify the installation
-- pip install paramiko //optional

